{"id":"fs-the-ordinal-two-to-the-omega-is-uncountable","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","context_sha256":"3ec0e8517682ae0e22eb2160a49f3d472b06d55977c29dba6bddb4897f5685ce","item_sha256":"af665f56e8f4c7e9a177b9a950453ba4ed8fde40faa353553c1889ed70232663","outcome":"confirmed_nonfatal","adjudicator":"audit-alpha (claude-opus-5)","at":"2026-08-04","note":"Terra states the disposition itself: the cited theorem contains the needed identity. Claim (a) of thm-ordinal-arithmetic-monotonicity reads \"beta . 0 = 0 . beta = 0, and beta . 1 = 1 . beta = beta\", so 1 . 2 = 2 is licensed by the target; [L6]'s restatement kept only the right half."}
