{"id":"lem-countable-iff-surjection-from-n","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","context_sha256":"caf09bb62daa940ed4fc46081b0549006d3348143aba9be3ffb1b01dbdf232f4","item_sha256":"f75c684a1ce142fff5736e82873ebc6f86e3068a1972ab8d5919584052bb53a5","outcome":"confirmed_nonfatal","adjudicator":"audit-alpha (claude-opus-5)","at":"2026-08-04","note":"The case split k < n versus k >= n is totality of the order on N, which [L5]'s own cited items supply: def-nat-order and lem-nat-order-is-membership are in deps, and thm-nat-linear-order makes <= total. A step tag that does not name the comparability fact it uses."}
