+
+## Recovery receipt — A8 adjudication (2026-08-08T10:31:00Z)
+
+- **Baseline and active stage verified:** `HEAD` is `84c52d136b16758747e7283118420cf88009148d`; the inherited dirty/untracked workspace was inspected and is being preserved. `research/audit/wave6-run-state.json` records A2, A3, A4, A6, and A7 complete and A8 active. The orchestrator's `pre-a8` stage snapshot exists at `2026-08-08T10:22:19.279Z`; its touch-ledger SHA-256 is `292c439efd616f3a8f847d4f0e8e643c4838aaaccdf349e235c760a59d07d383`.
