+- **A7 scope and current hashes verified from disk:** `wave6-rejudge-targets.json` contains exactly 13 repaired ids. All 13 current normalized item hashes match the `pre-a8` snapshot. The exact current hashes of the four rejected items are `thm-laurent-cauchy-complete` `cc1b09d79aa5ca608eb9ca2a715999b9b4e104e152abd9fcda66a1d06dca64d0`; `cex-zero-times-infinity-indeterminate` `c8540f4b61482b0e72b08333b770ac6f4f747c66680519ecc5f909e1b3c40d36`; `cor-convex-subsets-of-rn-are-contractible` `bb1cce791779ab85da116f724147aed63a1b269df655dfd034a4fbe41580cf38`; and `lem-straight-line-homotopies-are-continuous` `4421293444a41a1cc2c640107442e57e67780346c1f2c43db34dfb0274765967`.
+- **Current-context rejection set:** the 26 targeted A7 rows are exactly 13 ids by two models. DeepSeek V4 Pro kept all 13; GPT 5.6 Terra rejected the four ids named above. The other 67 rows are preserved evidence from an obsolete stopped full-wave attempt and are outside `wave6-rejudge-targets.json`, so they will not be adjudicated or allowed to expand A8.
