+receipt.attestation = 'Audit-Alpha reconciled the complete current 126-item scope and all 1,393 declared relationships from disk: 1,166 logical edges through exact proof-contract citations, 180 other current body uses, 13 metadata-only dependencies, and 34 orientation-only forward references. Every high/critical item has a current independent DeepSeek V4 Pro reading and an Alpha risk disposition; every A4 or A6 repair has an independent final-text reading. The 13-item A7 repair target is exact, and the four current Terra rejections are hash-bound in wave6-judge-adjudications.jsonl as confirmed nonfatal under the owner thirty-second rule. No A8 item text changed.';
