+  'thm-laurent-cauchy-complete': 'A4 added thm-nat-linear-order to license the natural-index comparisons in the Cauchy argument; Audit-Alpha verified the exact statement, hypotheses, direction, and current proof use, and the independent final-text reader certified it.',
